    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">LCA</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/lowest-common-ancestor-of-a-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 236</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Lowest Common Ancestor of a Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Let each call report what it found below it: nothing, p, q, or the answer. The first node that hears \"found\" from <b>both</b> children (or is p or q itself with the other below it) is the LCA. One post-order DFS, O(n) time, O(h) stack.</p>\n"
